@startuml
title State diagram of Digital Watch operations

state "Idle" as Idle
state "Adjusting Time Settings" as AdjustingTime
state "Adjusting Alarm Settings" as AdjustingAlarm
state "Alarm Ringing" as AlarmOn
state "Light Activated" as LightOn

[*] --> Idle

Idle : entry/Watch starts in idle mode
Idle : do/Display current time and date
Idle : exit/Button pressed to adjust settings

Idle --> AdjustingTime : button press

AdjustingTime : entry/User selects time adjustment
AdjustingTime : do/Increase values when adjusting
AdjustingTime : exit/Button released or setting complete

AdjustingTime --> Choice1 <<choice>>
AdjustingTime --> AdjustingAlarm : switch to alarm settings

Choice1 --> AlarmOn : enable alarm
Choice1 --> AdjustingTime : continue adjusting time

AdjustingAlarm : entry/User selects alarm adjustment
AdjustingAlarm : do/Set or change alarm time
AdjustingAlarm : exit/Save changes or cancel

AdjustingAlarm --> Choice2 <<choice>>
AdjustingAlarm --> AlarmOn : turn on alarm

Choice2 --> Idle : disable alarm
Choice2 --> AdjustingAlarm : continue adjusting

AlarmOn : entry/Alarm time matches current time
AlarmOn : do/Ring the alarm sound
AlarmOn : exit/Button pressed to stop alarm

AlarmOn --> Choice3 <<choice>>
AlarmOn --> LightOn : button press during alarm

Choice3 --> Idle : alarm stopped
Choice3 --> AlarmOn : continue ringing

LightOn : entry/Light activated by button press
LightOn : do/Illuminate display
LightOn : exit/Button released to turn off

LightOn --> Idle : light deactivated

@enduml
